{
 "id": "obd2_mode01",
 "version": 1,
 "name": {
  "en": "OBD-II live data (Service 01)",
  "zh-Hant": "OBD-II 即時資料（Service 01）"
 },
 "category": "vehicle",
 "description": {
  "en": "Cars and light vans through the OBD-II socket (pins 6 and 14): engine speed, vehicle speed, temperatures, fuel level, module voltage, asked for over ISO 15765-4. The car only answers questions, so this template sends requests — only after you turn on polling for the device. It never clears fault codes.",
  "zh-Hant": "經 OBD-II 接頭（6、14 腳）讀汽車和輕型車：引擎轉速、車速、溫度、油量、模組電壓，依 ISO 15765-4 詢問取得。車輛只回答問題，所以這個範本會送出請求——要在裝置上開啟「主動輪詢」後才會送。不會清除故障碼。"
 },
 "bitrate": 500000,
 "transmits": true,
 "manufacturer": "OBD-II",
 "model": "SAE J1979 / ISO 15765-4",
 "default_name": {
  "en": "Car",
  "zh-Hant": "汽車"
 },
 "source": [
  "ISO 15765-4:2005 (public.resource.org edition)",
  "Wikipedia: OBD-II PIDs (CC BY-SA 4.0)",
  "ELM327 data sheet (example frames)",
  "CSS Electronics OBD2 DBC v1.3 (MIT; start bits)"
 ],
 "license": "Facts from public documents, written by WOOWTECH; MIT",
 "verified": [
  "Example requests and responses from Wikipedia and the ELM327 data sheet, decoded both by the J1979 formulas and the DBC signals"
 ],
 "confidence": "high",
 "notes": {
  "en": "Polite polling: one request at a time, about 6.7 a second in all; PIDs the car does not have get no answer and are asked again only every minute. Most cars use 500 kbit/s and 11-bit IDs; for 29-bit cars set request_id 18DB33F1, reply_id 18DAF100, reply_mask 1FFFFF00. Many new cars have a gateway that only answers OBD requests: listening alone shows nothing there.",
  "zh-Hant": "有禮貌的輪詢：一次一個請求，合計每秒約 6.7 個；車子沒有的 PID 不會回答，之後每分鐘才再問一次。大多數車是 500 kbit/s、11-bit ID；29-bit 的車把 request_id 設 18DB33F1、reply_id 18DAF100、reply_mask 1FFFFF00。很多新車有閘道，只回 OBD 請求，單純監聽看不到東西。"
 },
 "params": [
  {
   "key": "request_id",
   "default": "7DF",
   "description": {
    "en": "Request ID (7DF = all OBD ECUs, 7E0 = engine only)",
    "zh-Hant": "請求 ID（7DF＝所有 OBD ECU、7E0＝只問引擎）"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "reply_id",
   "default": "7E8",
   "description": {
    "en": "Reply ID",
    "zh-Hant": "回覆 ID"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "reply_mask",
   "default": "7F8",
   "description": {
    "en": "Reply ID mask (7F8 = any of 7E8-7EF)",
    "zh-Hant": "回覆 ID 遮罩（7F8＝7E8–7EF 都收）"
   }
  }
 ],
